{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2023-04-28 12:07:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.59 PER SHARE FOR SECOND QUARTER AND ANNOUNCES PLANS FOR DIVIDEND INCREASE IN THIRD QUARTER', 'text': 'BATTLE CREEK, MICH. , APRIL 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KELLOGG COMPANY (NYSE: K) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.59 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2023, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 1, 2023.'}